# Phase 1 — Tasks

Now create the fundamental object around which everything else revolves.

Start simple:

```text
Task

id
client
jiraKey
title
status
nextAction
createdAt
updatedAt
```

Implement these states:

```text
NEW
WORKING
PAUSED
WAITING_FOR_CLIENT
WAITING_FOR_REVIEW
DONE
```

UI might initially look like:

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│ ACME                            │
│ ABC-123                         │
│ Fix contract generation        │
│                                 │
│ Next: investigate Apex trigger │
│                                 │
│          ▶ START               │
├─────────────────────────────────┤
│ ABC-124  Waiting for client    │
│ XYZ-88   Paused                │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

No Jira integration yet. Enter tasks manually.

Use it for real work for a few days. You'll discover UX problems much faster than designing everything theoretically.

